---
layout: base.njk
title: Harvard Abundance Fund
permalink: /harvard-abundance-fund/index.html
description: Projects funded through the Abundance Donor-Advised Fund at Harvard University.
---
{%- from "icons.njk" import icon -%}
{% set ph = { title: "Harvard Abundance Fund", eyebrow: "Our work", color: "teal", image: "/img/s1.jpg", lead: "Some of Abundance’s work is funded through the Abundance Donor-Advised Fund at Harvard University." } %}
{% include "pagehead.njk" %}
<section class="wrap area-intro">
  <div class="lead-big"><p>The Harvard Abundance Fund supports work coordinated with Harvard Medical School’s Department of Global Health and Social Medicine and its partners. Other projects are funded directly by the Abundance Foundation, a 501(c)(3) public charity. Each project page says which vehicle supported it.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="haf-h">
  <h2 id="haf-h" class="h-section">Projects</h2>
  <div class="cards cards-3">
    {% for p in hub.haf %}
    {% set a = hub.areaBySlug[p.area] %}
    <article class="card tone-{{ a.color }}">
      <a class="card-img{% if 'placeholder' in p.thumb %} is-placeholder{% endif %}" href="{{ p.href }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{% if p.thumb %}<img src="{{ p.thumb }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</a>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="tag">{{ a.name }}</p>
        <h3><a href="{{ p.href }}">{{ p.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ p.summary }}{% if not p.summary.endsWith('.') %}…{% endif %}</p>
        <a class="more" href="{{ p.href }}">Read more {{ icon("arrow", 18) }}</a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
